    973  fcb8							; --- expand band mask -> BandTab $ff/$00 ×3 (bit0 ENABL + bit7 pack) ---
    974  fcb8							; --- Phase 5: stage the M1 x-offset for the door SIDE. A door has no
    975  fcb8							; ball (its asym rows resolve to None → band mask $00), so MetaA bit0
    976  fcb8							; is free: 1 = M1 strip on the RIGHT half (x = 87+8*col → offset +79),
    977  fcb8							; 0 = left (x = 7+8*col → offset -1). The M1 block adds it via
    978  fcb8							; clc/adc RectCount. MetaA bit0 is ALSO the band-0 ball gate — the
    979  fcb8							; no-ball path below blanks BandTab so it never enables the ball.
    980  fcb8							; RectCount ($92) is free in the VBL (kernel re-inits RowIdx at entry;
    981  fcb8							; the pack uses $8F).
