   1182  fe9c							; HOVHotPfGate (plan 5.1b, 2026-10-20) — legacy hot rect parent test. The
   1183  fe9c							; record's own PF cell must still be solid: a thin parent wall is a bombable
   1184  fe9c							; cell, so a blast punches it and the hot piece dies with the wall (this is
   1185  fe9c							; the PF form of the retired WallMask AND). Entered from HotOverlapBody's hit
   1186  fe9c							; path with Y = record base (mask,x,y,w,h) after the box overlap passed.
   1187  fe9c							; Exits: cell solid -> HOVlegHit (kill), cell empty -> HOVnext (pass/advance).
